Output final-raw.gif
Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 15
Set Width 1280
Set Height 760
Set Padding 20
Set MarginFill "#0d1117"
Set Margin 0
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 40ms
Set Framerate 20

Hide
Type "unset FUXI_DEBUG; cd ~/dev/calc-demo && clear"
Enter
Sleep 300ms
Show

Type "fuxi"
Sleep 250ms
Enter
Sleep 9s

Type "Fix the failing test in this project, then run python3 test_calculator.py to confirm it passes."
Sleep 250ms
Enter
Sleep 24s

Enter
Sleep 20s

Enter
Sleep 16s

Enter
Sleep 10s
